  "body": "Sea views, single level, brick & tile!\r\n\r\nThis is the Half Moon Bay lifestyle you've been waiting for. 1/4 Coquille Place is a sun-filled single level brick and tile home with two bedrooms, a wrap-around deck overlooking stunning sea views and beautifully kept gardens that just happens to be in one of East Auckland's most sought-after coastal pockets.\r\n\r\nInside, the home is filled with natural light. The kitchen and living areas open out to a sun-soaked deck that wraps around the home. Sea views and beautifully landscaped gardens set the scene for morning coffee in the sunshine, summer barbecues or an evening drink as the day winds down.\r\n\r\nBoth bedrooms are comfortable, the bathroom is well placed and a separate laundry keeps household chores out of sight. With an internal garage, secure parking and storage is covered also providing you with direct access to the home.\r\n\r\nWhether you're downsizing, planning your retirement or taking your first step onto the property ladder, this solid brick and tile home is easy to love. Everything is on a single level and a quiet street, brings a welcome sense of peace.\r\n\r\nStep outside and the coast is right there. Nature and beach walks are two minutes away and Half Moon Bay Marina is a 10 minute stroll. Waterfront walks, weekend coffees and evenings by the sea become part of your routine rather than a drive away. Explore the coastal walkways, enjoy the nearby amenities and settle into the lifestyle that makes this such a desirable place to live.\r\n\r\nSea views, a sun-soaked deck and Half Moon Bay Marina close by. Contact us today to arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\nFind more properties you may like at http://www.teamvishrealestate.co.nz",
